---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE_NAME, SITE_TITLE, pageHref } from '../lib/site';
---
<Base title={`About · ${SITE_NAME}`}>
  <header class="wrap site-head">
    <a class="site-name" href={pageHref()}>{SITE_NAME}</a>
    <nav class="site-nav" aria-label="Site">
      <a href={pageHref()}>All isms and themes</a>
      <a href={pageHref('method')}>Method</a>
    </nav>
  </header>
  <main id="main" class="wrap">
    <article class="prose">
      <h1>About</h1>
      <p>Since November 2022 it has felt as if history started again with AI. It didn't. The people building AI carry ideas with long histories, and those ideas have names: transhumanism, rationalism, effective accelerationism and others.</p>
      <p>This site is a genealogy of those isms. It starts with what each one holds today and follows its roots back in time, so that anyone can see where the arguments about AI come from and speak about them with a shared vocabulary.</p>
      <p>It is being developed alongside a planned exhibition, and it will keep growing: new isms, new themes and new roots are added as the research goes on.</p>
      <p class="mono" style="font-size: 14px; color: #555555">First draft. All texts are being checked against their sources.</p>
    </article>
  </main>
</Base>
